Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:19.32,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui é a Pixelzada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:22.53,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Neste vídeo a gente atravessa o mapa de GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.55,0:00:25.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ponta a ponta: a cidade, as praias, as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:28.22,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ilhas, o pântano e até a tal montanha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:30.90,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E em cada parada eu te mostro o que a Rockstar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:32.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,copiou da vida real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:34.43,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se você vai jogar no lançamento, já se
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:36.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,inscreve, porque essa semana o canal vai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:37.37,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ferver.
