Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.68,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Primeiro, um pouco de história.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:41.88,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City não é novidade na série.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:45.23,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ela apareceu em 2002, em GTA Vice City, presa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.25,0:00:48.37,Legenda,,0,0,0,,nos anos oitenta, com terno pastel, neon e
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:50.18,Legenda,,0,0,0,,trilha de sintetizador.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:52.26,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Era a Miami dos filmes de crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:55.37,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Mais de vinte anos depois, a cidade volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:58.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Só que agora nos dias de hoje, com celular na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mão, rede social e todo mundo filmando tudo.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.89,0:00:39.60,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA VICE CITY · 2002
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.85,0:00:41.80,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA VICE CITY · 2002
