Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:30.73,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Até agora, a Rockstar mostrou seis regiões.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.75,0:01:32.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City, a capital do neon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:35.64,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Leonida Keys, o colar de ilhas no sul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:37.51,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Grassrivers, o pântano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:39.60,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Port Gellhorn, na costa do Golfo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:41.08,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ambrosia, no interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:44.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E o Mount Kalaga, um parque nacional no norte.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:45.46,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vamos uma por uma.
