Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.82,0:02:12.87,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tem mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:15.88,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Miami é conhecida como a capital mundial dos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:19.03,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cruzeiros, e Vice City tem porto, iate, lancha
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:20.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,e jet ski para todo lado.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.85,0:02:23.47,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Os prédios espelhados do centro, as pontes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:26.23,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ligando a cidade à praia, as festas na beira
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:26.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do mar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:29.62,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Quem já viu Miami de perto vai reconhecer a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:30.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade em segundos.
