Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.33,0:02:34.61,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Descendo para o sul, chegamos em Leonida Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:37.50,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na vida real, as Florida Keys são uma corrente
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:40.39,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ilhas ligadas por uma única estrada sobre o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:43.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mar, a Overseas Highway, com quarenta e duas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:43.74,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pontes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:46.29,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Uma delas tem quase onze quilômetros.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:49.46,Legenda,,0,0,0,,É água azul-turquesa dos dois lados, barco de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:52.57,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pesca, bar de praia e muita gente fugindo da
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:53.23,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:56.10,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Nos trailers, essa vibe aparece em festa em
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:58.79,Legenda,,0,0,0,,barco, passeio de lancha e areia branca.
