Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:32.49,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Do outro lado do estado, na costa do Golfo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.51,0:03:33.85,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fica Port Gellhorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.87,0:03:36.46,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se Vice City é o cartão-postal, Port Gellhorn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:38.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,é a praia que ficou para trás.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.27,0:03:40.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Cidade portuária, motel de beira de estrada,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:43.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,casa noturna com letreiro piscando e bem menos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:44.12,Legenda,,0,0,0,,glamour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:46.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tudo indica que a inspiração vem do norte da
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:48.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,costa do Golfo da Flórida, a região que os
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:50.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,americanos chamam de Panhandle.
